{"authors": [], "discovered_at": "2026-10-06T02:52:11.842965Z", "id": "github:release:787462297:release:404009895", "kind": "release", "matched_terms": [], "metadata": {"action": "released", "draft": false, "forks": 814, "prerelease": false, "stars": 5568, "stars_delta": 2, "tag_name": "v0.7.5"}, "organization": "Blaizzy", "priority": {"source": 0.5}, "published_at": "2026-10-05T18:31:58Z", "related_items": [], "scores": {}, "source": "github", "source_id": "787462297:release:404009895", "summary": "## What's Changed\r\n* Enable Qwen3-Omni multimodal batching by @Lazarus-931 in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/2349\r\n* Review/extraction test harness by @Lazarus-931 in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/2394\r\n* Fix broken CI: Qwen-compatible tokenizer in the processor regression test  by @Lazarus-931 in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/2401\r\n* Add Decider and the shared typed decision API by @Lazarus-931 in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/2396\r\n* Add Laya on the shared decision API by @Lazarus-931 in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/2397\r\n* Keep the most likely MoG component for a tiny top_p in Nemotron VoiceChat by @pierre427 in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/2405\r\n* Stop gradients on MoE router selection indices (MLX >= 0.32.1) by @Lazarus-931 in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/2409\r\n* removing duplicate rotate_half and check_array_shape funcs by @Lazarus-931 in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/2414\r\n* Feat/decision cli by @Lazarus-931 in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/2402\r\n* Add conversation compaction to the Responses API by @Blaizzy in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/2408\r\n* Fix prequantized Qwen4 PLE loading by @Lazarus-931 in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/2417\r\n* Fix PhiMoE routing and plain RoPE configs by @Lazarus-931 in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/2419\r\n* Compute top-p and typical-p probability mass in float32 by @pierre427 in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/2404\r\n* qwen3_vl: take video timestamps from the frames that were actually sampled by @Marian2110 in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/2413\r\n* Bump version to 0.7.5 by @lucasnewman in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/2432\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @Marian2110 made their first contribution in https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/pull/2413\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/compare/v0.7.4...v0.7.5", "title": "Blaizzy/mlx-vlm v0.7.5", "topics": ["vision_language_models"], "updated_at": "2026-10-05T18:31:58Z", "url": "https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm/releases/tag/v0.7.5", "venue": null}
